  "_about": "The Hollow (docs/SLICE.md screen 7), Witch Way's own painting (witch_game_assets/backgrounds/hollow.webp): a marsh graveyard in the Gloamwood, at the end of the way from the Sable bridge, which is off the bottom left. The cobbles come in at the bottom left corner, run up past the rubble and the bone-hung tree with its rune stones, over a short footbridge across the black stream, and wind up past the graves to three steps and an iron gate between two lit lanterns, which stays shut. The Gloamwing (B3) hangs in the bone-hung tree on the left; Inkblot's nest is in the tree on the right. Every position is in painting pixels (x right, y down) plus, for the floor, a height in meters. Check changes with: python3 tools/overlay.py scenes/the-hollow.json out.png",
